{"ticker":"CMS","updated":"2026-11-06T23:04:08Z","profile":{"longName":"CMS Energy Corporation","shortName":"CMS Energy Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cmsenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":8350,"marketCap":21696620544,"trailingPE":24.707144,"forwardPE":16.692806,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.417451,"pegRatio":2.55,"targetMeanPrice":73.84615,"targetHighPrice":78.0,"targetLowPrice":68.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.08,"earningsGrowth":-0.579,"grossMargins":0.40758,"operatingMargins":0.28447,"profitMargins":0.09716,"totalRevenue":8974999552,"beta":0.297,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":80.36,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.29,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.23},"summary":"CMS Energy Corporation operates as an energy company primarily in Michigan. The company operates through three segments: Electric Utility; Gas Utility; and NorthStar Clean Energy. The Electric Utility segment is involved in the generation, purchase, distribution, and sale of electricity. This segment generates electricity through coal, wind, gas, renewable energy, oil, and nuclear sources. Its distribution system comprises 263 miles of high-voltage distribution overhead lines; 4 miles of high-voltage distribution underground lines; 4,619 miles of high-voltage distribution overhead lines; 18 miles of high-voltage distribution underground lines; 82,854 miles of electric distribution overhead lines; 10,027 miles of underground distribution lines; and 1,102 substations. The Gas Utility segment engages in the purchase, transmission, storage, distribution, and sale of natural gas, which includes 2,337 miles of transmission lines; 14 gas storage fields; 28,433 miles of distribution mains; and 8 compressor stations. The NorthStar Clean Energy segment is involved in the independent power production and marketing, including the development and operation of renewable generation. The company serves 1.9 million electric and 1.8 million gas customers, including residential, commercial, and diversified industrial customers. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Jackson,","summary_zh":"CMS Energy Corporation 作為一家能源公司主要在密西根州運營。該公司透過三個部門運作：電力部門；燃氣公用事業；和北極星清潔能源。電力部門涉及電力的發電、購買、分配和銷售。該部門透過煤炭、風能、天然氣、再生能源、石油和核能發電。其配電系統包括 263 英里的高壓配電架空線路； 4英里長的高壓配電地下線路； 4,619 英里的高壓配電架空線路； 18英里的高壓配電地下線路； 82,854 英里的配電架空線路； 10,027 英里的地下接線；天然氣公用事業部門從事天然氣的購買、傳輸、儲存、分配和銷售，其中包括 2,337 英里的傳輸線； 14個儲氣庫； 28,433 英里的配電幹線；和8個壓縮機站。北極星清潔能源部門從事獨立電力生產和行銷，包括再生能源發電的開發和營運。該公司為 190 萬電力客戶和 180 萬燃氣客戶提供服務，包括住宅、商業和多元化工業客戶。該公司成立於 1987 年，總部位於傑克遜，","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":71.29,"h":71.38,"l":70.52,"c":70.69,"v":1705500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":70.45,"h":71.17,"l":70.4,"c":70.91,"v":1479500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":70.88,"h":71.34,"l":70.53,"c":71.22,"v":1798600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":71.3,"h":71.77,"l":70.93,"c":71.67,"v":1618800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":71.43,"h":71.9,"l":71.17,"c":71.68,"v":1911100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":71.58,"h":72.0,"l":71.56,"c":71.58,"v":2803100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":71.17,"h":71.44,"l":69.92,"c":69.96,"v":2012100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":70.32,"h":71.14,"l":70.26,"c":70.38,"v":1941000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":69.81,"h":70.67,"l":69.76,"c":70.18,"v":2005300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":70.34,"h":70.54,"l":69.82,"c":70.12,"v":5110600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":70.27,"h":70.75,"l":70.17,"c":70.44,"v":1964300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":70.24,"h":71.61,"l":70.16,"c":71.49,"v":1706000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":71.46,"h":72.03,"l":71.34,"c":71.66,"v":2015100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":71.94,"h":72.22,"l":69.82,"c":70.98,"v":4981800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":71.27,"h":71.9,"l":70.97,"c":71.84,"v":2200400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":71.71,"h":72.98,"l":71.38,"c":72.77,"v":3034800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":73.0,"h":73.44,"l":72.62,"c":73.26,"v":1969100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":72.96,"h":73.45,"l":72.33,"c":72.37,"v":2237700},{"